  "senior_ml_engineer_verdict": "HONEST SENIOR VERDICT: 1. Leakage Impact: Adding the unlagged heartbeat feature artificially inflated PR-AUC from 0.2540 to 0.2873 and Precision from 20.26% to 18.29%. 2. Clean Model vs Rules: On the genuine electrical target without leakage, LightGBM achieves 20.26% precision vs Rules 7.63% (a 2.7x precision lift), while cutting false alarm episodes from 0.14 to 0.26 ep/dev/wk. However, incident-level event recall is 89.7% compared to Rules 41.4%. Therefore, the ML model serves as a precision filter, while deterministic rules must remain active as a safety net."
